# Calibration RESULTS are experiment output: regenerable, machine specific,
# and sometimes large (sync runs with --save-images). They stay local.
#
# The hand-maintained CONFIG files are the exception -- they are inputs, they
# are edited by hand, and losing them loses real measurements. The repo-wide
# .gitignore ignores *.json everywhere, so they must be re-included here by
# name or `git add` will silently skip them.
data/

!charuco_board.json
!ee_camera_transforms.json

__pycache__/
